Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.16,0:00:10.84,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's a first title of 2026 for Leylah Fernandez{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N费尔南德斯的{\fs78}2026{\fs68}年首冠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.94,0:00:12.79,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}差一分就丢掉第一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.79,0:00:14.88,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}费尔南德斯之后连赢{\fs78}8{\fs68}局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.88,0:00:16.80,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}拿下新加坡的冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.80,0:00:19.32,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}9{\fs68}月{\fs78}27{\fs68}号傍晚{\fs78}5{\fs68}点多
