Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.08,0:01:45.82,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}她先后拿到{\fs78}4{\fs68}个破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.82,0:01:47.72,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}前{\fs78}3{\fs68}个都被吉布森救了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.72,0:01:50.24,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}第四个才破下来 {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.24,0:01:53.70,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}整场比赛 就是从这一局翻过去的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.62,0:01:56.39,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}该她发球胜盘了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.39,0:01:59.40,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fs78}15{\fs68}比{\fs78}40{\fs68} 她先救下两个破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.40,0:02:02.10,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}差一点就被破回 占先
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.10,0:02:05.63,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}盘点 这一分拿下 {\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.16,0:02:09.08,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Just about squeezing through the first set{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N惊险拿下第一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.08,0:02:12.84,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Leylah Fernandez roars her way{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N费尔南德斯吼了出来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.84,0:02:17.40,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Remember, she was set point down a few games ago{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N几局之前 她还面对着盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.40,0:02:20.12,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It was so tight all the way through{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一盘从头到尾都咬得很紧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.12,0:02:24.32,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}over an hour but Fernandez picks it up. 7比5{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N一个多小时 她拿下了 {\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.42,0:02:25.71,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}第二盘第一局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.71,0:02:28.06,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}费尔南德斯拿到破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.06,0:02:30.36,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}这一分又是底线相持
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.36,0:02:32.03,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}费尔南德斯左右跑动
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.03,0:02:34.13,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}一球都没丢 拿下这一分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.13,0:02:36.65,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}破发 第一盘那股劲还在
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.65,0:02:39.54,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}第二盘她一上来就不给机会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.06,0:02:43.95,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}这一分两人在底线对拉了很久
