Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.48,0:03:58.30,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}决赛第一盘两人咬了一个多小时
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.30,0:04:01.10,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}第二盘只打了{\fs78}33{\fs68}分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.32,0:04:07.80,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, you could just tell how excited she was{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N看得出来她有多兴奋
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.80,0:04:10.76,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}to be in Singapore and to be in Southeast Asia,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N能来新加坡 来东南亚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.76,0:04:13.72,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}somewhere that she loves so much{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她特别喜欢这里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.72,0:04:18.12,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And what a final it was{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这场决赛真精彩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.12,0:04:21.32,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That tight first set and then she ran away with it{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第一盘咬得很紧 之后一路甩开
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.42,0:04:24.10,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}她走向场边 抱住了父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.10,0:04:25.77,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}这一年的第一个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.77,0:04:28.23,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}来得晚了点 但够漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.23,0:04:31.23,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}下一站 她还能接着赢吗？
